%description:
Tests acceptBeyondBufferAtEmptyQueue=true. The server offers 2000 bytes, and
the tester adds 3000 bytes to the first data segment, so A003 reaches beyond
the window and the buffer, as from a peer that ignores the window. As Linux
(tcp_data_queue()), the server accepts the whole segment, because its receive
queue is empty, and offers a zero window until the application reads. Without
the parameter, the server drops the segment. The simulation stops after the
ACK, because the client then gets an ACK of bytes that it did not send.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 1.004s
*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 1000"
*.*_tcp.mss = 1000
*.*_tcp.delayedAcksEnabled = false
*.srv_tcp.advertisedWindow = 2000
*.srv_tcp.acceptBeyondBufferAtEmptyQueue = true
*.srv_app.autoRead=false
*.srv_app.readScript="3 10000"
*.tcptester.script="a3 data 3000"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.001 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[0.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 500:500(0) ack 1 win 2000   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[0.005 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:4001(4000) ack 501 win 16384 # adding data
[1.003 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 4001 win 0 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
